WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.385
Cora looked around.

2
00:00:04.386 --> 00:00:08.420
The hungry seagull was holding a starfish!

3
00:00:08.421 --> 00:00:15.121
"Oh, no you don't!" Cora zoomed closer.

4
00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:18.403
"Leave Star alone!"

5
00:00:18.404 --> 00:00:22.048
She grabbed the bird's leg with her tentacle.

6
00:00:22.049 --> 00:00:25.948
"Drop Star right now!" she yelled.

7
00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:29.080
But the seagull was strong.

8
00:00:29.081 --> 00:00:34.198
"No!" It squawked. "This is my dinner!"

9
00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:37.241
"Help, Cora!" Star shouted.

10
00:00:37.242 --> 00:00:40.332
The seagull shook Cora off.

11
00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:45.881
It flew up high.

12
00:00:45.882 --> 00:00:48.799
Cora heard another sound.

13
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:54.800
"Hey! Let go of that starfish!" someone snapped.

14
00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.939
"That's my dinner!"

15
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:01.178
"Walt!" Mo cried.

16
00:01:01.179 --> 00:01:06.334
"Drop the starfish right now!" Walt yelled.

17
00:01:06.335 --> 00:01:11.194
"Or I'll tell everyone where your nest is.

18
00:01:11.195 --> 00:01:15.784
Somebody will steal your eggs!"

19
00:01:15.785 --> 00:01:19.570
"Fine!" The seagull dropped the starfish.

20
00:01:19.571 --> 00:01:24.006
Star fell and hit the water hard. Splash!

21
00:01:24.007 --> 00:01:28.411
Mo gulped. "I hope she's okay."

22
00:01:28.412 --> 00:01:36.376
"Me too," Cora said. "Let's look for her!"

23
00:01:36.377 --> 00:01:39.508
Cora looked up at the arrow.

24
00:01:39.509 --> 00:01:43.242
Whoosh! It shot into the water.

25
00:01:43.243 --> 00:01:47.493
"Come on, Mo!" Cora said.

26
00:01:47.494 --> 00:01:51.184
They followed the arrow along the seafloor.

27
00:01:51.185 --> 00:01:55.508
Then Mo spotted something. "Uh-oh.

28
00:01:55.509 --> 00:01:57.861
Walt is following us.

29
00:01:57.862 --> 00:02:01.057
He wants to eat Star for dinner!"

30
00:02:01.058 --> 00:02:09.939
"No way!" Cora said. "We'll find her first!"

